vin! Looking forward to hearing your new tunes. Keep me updated on how your collaborations go!\n[S2T18] (dia_id: D2:18)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, no worries! I'll definitely let you know how it goes. Cheers!\n[S2T19] (dia_id: D2:19)\n\nDave: Enjoy the collaborations, Calvin! Stay safe!\n[S2T20] (dia_id: D2:20)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Gonna have fun and stay safe with it. Bye!\n[S2T21] (dia_id: D2:21)","text_sha256":"a34f06974e7118751298b8f475e07bea0ec3852bd5acec20f663a904c697ba45","timestamp":"2023-03-26T16:45:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S3T1]"],"text_sha256":"60de5c5ec1bff27a88cb70259801cd6554101ae3253fea90c34d0c5b708de5ff"},{"dia_ids":["D3:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S3T2]"],"text_sha256":"1f66808dd922f25ddf5cfd921da16628146a3cfaf9d24090e2abe3ca1c90b610"},{"dia_ids":["D3:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S3T3]"],"text_sha256":"968324bcdc2984e4b25fadd10acbde510b87311a5ea843476a96d0863556786b"},{"dia_ids":["D3:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S3T4]"],"text_sha256":"992ce7de476408001520f96954131b2a25787782260aa74b4ce86f4d6a6ba1b6"},{"dia_ids":["D3:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S3T5]"],"text_sha256":"18e5765822cdb05ccfc3b58dfe2950ab2e849da4a4d751342021c1eb9adc8a04"},{"dia_ids":["D3:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S3T6]"],"text_sha256":"5d4ccaad157e453260dd33df75f99cfd4730e8ef567442e44c020cca07b54060"},{"dia_ids":["D3:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S3T7]"],"text_sha256":"3b5882ccb2181b4c0bc85727fd1375106260cabee5c80792ad404817c7c22e81"},{"dia_ids":["D3:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":34,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S3T8]"],"text_sha256":"a31f66